{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】「萬代南夢宮」攤位報導！空戰奇兵8與異戰3等豪華5款作品可試玩展出</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/70e1112c8e630c4f47403f065beb7898b2fca43528dc15db81bd805255ffe929/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5f060cfc97c76bf6f99d21038bae6d67.jpg\"/><p>2026年9月17日(四)～20日(日)舉辦的遊戲慶典「 東京電玩展2026 (TGS2026)」 這次要報導「 萬代南夢宮 娛樂 」攤位！</p><h3>可試玩人氣作品的「萬代南夢宮娛樂」攤位報導</h3><p>以巨大螢幕上映預告</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/79a2a1b2c88d3bb247906e523971585a933aff70db5eb099c6bd3e568505cc77/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7416d38dfb90e44f0c80b3a8ccaedd04.png\"/><p>潛入TGS常客企業之一的「萬代南夢宮娛樂」攤位！ 今年5個人氣IP的新作遊戲全都可以試玩展出。 光是這個攤位，就會讓人對萬代南夢宮的IP知名度感到驚訝。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f99468c2376d2b8c09e797376be20c6c5ae1781959f5e8e8829a3cb080fe24c7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9e0aab119d06b72796c9bc512fc82d12.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/88e513ee31b61776d62db47b6832dc2cb4b0fe1eb7ac720281c0d1a718996cc0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F694a6e7eb3d984f62e56a530a6ba196c.png\"/><p>作為睽違約7年的新作，話題沸騰的 空戰奇兵8 希孚之翼 。 因為在大螢幕上非常顯眼，停下腳步的人應該也很多吧。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/883a679a204e6348887082e955a6bc693cbd7108aa645bc9698bac6ba530c2cd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F123cbcba7d27bf502ad2ca45614f283f.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9d1f1cc333b91895c2005688ab738fd7abd50a66444ce7ef6a86ce681f8aac7f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F84375244f6eea06f99b6eef2337a4d5b.png\"/><p>整體簡潔的裝飾，與遊戲氛圍十分相襯，令人印象深刻。</p><p>七龍珠 異戰3 預定2027年發售！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5abdbc5de97a32cd6ebdcb404936678aa2c25825673391932c7ddf11c123b2b1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb7273a0de4663f1975a6836eeabbf489.png\"/><p>由曾負責原作漫畫的已故鳥山明老師參與角色設計的 七龍珠 異戰3 。 在比ACE COMBAT區域更大螢幕上映的PV，簡直就像龜派氣功般的衝擊。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/48ca65c9676094f0972ee045c39063c6625e63d9327fbd6d260ee18ea9bc5ac8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5a26724149540f8ff075cdb7dc9a6d26.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/43761893432b6e7e1cbdf232f30d66eb25b0548cc2c73beb2529a3938599296b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc8a64017dbafbb9b0e123babc8c589e8.png\"/><p>試玩等候隊伍中，許多人正讀著操作說明，為戰鬥做準備。</p><p>宛如機動戰士甲板般的試玩區</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5b1769a3fd9532ac37bde05af7cd188d5f5e140cd96a1607ad3d4766e40012df/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbdb3f23f7ba68ae6f0e2a01ea62ac34f.png\"/><p>在眾多鋼彈遊戲中，以好的意義散發異彩氛圍的 GUNDAM ROGUE ORBIT 區域。</p><p>抽中後可坐上去的特別試玩台</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dd9f1455866de72f5868a25c32bfb929111e4a17cfe205054bb9f3aa3f6c41f4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F09ee46cae070b9c25169ca691f6f2005.png\"/><p>除了通常的試玩之外，也設置了以主角機體駕駛艙為意象的特別試玩台。 這是喜歡鋼彈的人都曾憧憬、搭乘機動戰士的夢想實現的瞬間。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/574edad4ade62864ad3efedf40dda920d1ca1fe916e2277de348d6faa685d454/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F991e07425f6facb8d7de485a969db55e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/26a7c9a8dd8d83ef8e8d03ed442f5f88215336625bd4e0bede34129a0c0cdab3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F207eb04c54111c31ee3f20b1e3300737.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/878cc20659217802707f7cb8736095d46491f888d1fe5291d419b83747cbab4e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc62f2e51e58ea165837e5c275bed9a02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/766bdac38193de442e45da87584f6e7d81b8fbef55e88ab8a7399eab835fbcac/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6471bd4769beb380cc5a925b20dbd419.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f61a6ab202bc556a0186ad5df181ffdea75354097e897d777f5ceb7411c34c00/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1d4150094e708f897019d1371b5f2776.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bcc49f149e5afe091a2f28f4c8880f1e8a4c9180b73d0141d83d8b4a677ef57b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1885a86f3db4bee705c5e8a54c79cc9d.jpg\"/><p>此外，也搶先展示了與遊戲相關機體的鋼彈模型。 起初我還誤以為是手辦，但透過展示框架，就能實際感受到那是塑膠模型。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7644e182693189ec2d4f5adb558346139c277bef5984eee1daa0e52baf14e55c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd0a2bd8487600e7df593ff50c9c380e9.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/271aad198cae58b8e6a5b29806354697ff70234b5afa9ec35ba4407474b79b98/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0ad18c3c0255af8c09303620abcd0ccd.jpg\"/><p>更展示了至今為止的鋼彈遊戲一覽表。 能看出鋼彈系列延續得多麼長久。 戰場之絆之類的好懷念啊・・・。</p><p>BLEACH Mirrors High區</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/215f80ad0f2c46d5f347852a669fa2a7a8cf4b8fc698c13d42dd6ab57742a756/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fca297ae5f1f03cb33ebe371974cfe352.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7542112210dfc9c11f5982e41dee823dfdcfb5448c701708704d06a8834b697d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd29872d2b026c14f5528111725c8ec1f.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e5f5af6e7b0ddf31473b234efdec48814d424718e94b6f3b4b62b124b9568465/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F56a011d9364b967307d98308f623f2d7.jpg\"/><p>時髦角色們十分吸睛的 BLEACH Mirrors High 區。 由於也描繪了原作漫畫之後的故事，是粉絲期待的作品。</p><p>拍攝後才發現紀念品是倒的</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a2070bcadb02bf7eef9deda47b41500a0a81f646d8b47e351f5ee7e1fecd1caf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F04dd8186252edad4ec0176d06e154ec2.jpg\"/><p>事前登錄即可獲得原創徽章！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8e85ab05d228566fd622f1831fe8c30e9435919207f7aabe8589d48f8c6cc1a1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F516c1dad5e2db4f1803fd3ff3c81fc5a.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3dcb3f28fed9c34ceb51adf259d3ac2838297316d91831067ca1324988f07061/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1713f0c21d0a15836b1642a61b9d82dc.jpg\"/><p>在萬代南夢宮娛樂攤位中，我個人印象深刻的，是「 ONE PIECE 海洋盛宴 」的區域。 可愛的玩偶十分吸睛。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/472e5acc97a3574cd709ede7a462b244b3285880a2e55a925fa71c678ab9cc66/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdd38e62d66b04dc0917ec3753d15b2ae.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/002f9c379874398de24843ee45479514de5464ee7a01b4e33c5a94ad2e7c802c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2948f40d4d13a0607f6cc4e73e32efa0.png\"/><p>試玩區也是以遊戲中登場的「芭拉蒂2號店」為意象的內裝！ 工作人員也身穿專用服裝，幹勁十足。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4e557168d0ff791de6ca0327f9732c7ae7e40c169a2646f89b488051b637a816/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F10c216c3f2cd4fedfbde1b907e073104.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/74267ff5341f569113059afa1f79f8fecb4240723a1be77e4f3ac2f1053648bc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb0ce6d03d0b82c5ed3cd40dfde47d77f.jpg\"/><p>也設置了菜單表等，明明是遊戲展卻像來到餐廳一樣。 如果這裡還有會動的草帽一行人，就完美了說・・・。</p><p>「CHOPPER's」的喬巴也跳進TGS了！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fa13ee185244da9c2672a9c3f6eb358b2eafc0b2529ecc7f2562d64ed41555ab/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F901060605ccb5fbfb5b3c44a12ad9d32.jpg\"/><p>才這麼想，區域附近就突然出現了喬巴！ 能遇見這樣的角色果然令人開心！！</p><p>以上，就是萬代南夢宮娛樂攤位！</p><p>🔸【TGS2026】將人類3D化放進手機！？能體驗次世代內容生成的「KDDI」攤位報導！ 🔸【TGS2026】「集英社遊戲」攤位報導！「咒術迴戰激鬥: 倖存潮汐」與「UN:Me 非我:擇誰」大排長龍 🔸【TGS2026】「SEGA／ATLUS」攤位報導！「女神異聞錄4 Revival」試玩與Ado的語音訊息等 🔸【TGS2026】「Pixio」攤位報導！能以自己的風格妝點桌面週邊的新作電競配件應有盡有 🔸【TGS2026】「Lenovo」攤位報導！體驗現實與遊戲融合的《鬼武者 Way of the Sword》特別活動</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T13:21:51.927191+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1262,"images":30,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}